    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d515-a2">

                <pb facs="0493" n="395" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg395"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure.—Telegram sent.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to Mr. Martin.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pekin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-12-20"><hi rendition="#italic">December 20,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Insist with viceroy that Yang-Sze-Chen be returned to Chinkiang, as
                    requested.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Conger.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
